## Branch: control

# Heading on survey screens 1 to 3 of a short in-product survey shown to new Firefox users. Keep it short: it sits on one line in a narrow panel.
nuts-title = Raccontaci la tua esperienza con Firefox
# Survey question. Keep the quoted statement close to the English meaning: Firefox keeps its privacy and security promises.
nuts-q-integrity = Quanto sei d’accordo o in disaccordo con la seguente affermazione? “Firefox mantiene le promesse che fa in materia di privacy e sicurezza.”
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-strongly-disagree = Assolutamente in disaccordo
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-disagree = Non sono d’accordo
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-neither = Né d'accordo né in disaccordo
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-agree = D’accordo
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-strongly-agree = Assolutamente d’accordo
# Button that moves to the next survey question.
nuts-next = Avanti
# Link to Mozilla's Firefox privacy notice.
nuts-privacy-notice = Informativa sulla privacy
# Survey question. Keep the quoted statement close to the English meaning: Firefox cares about the user, not only about making money.
nuts-q-benevolence = Quanto sei d’accordo o in disaccordo con la seguente affermazione? “Firefox ha a cuore i miei interessi, non solo il proprio profitto.”
# Survey question about the person's past use of Firefox.
nuts-q-tenure = Quale delle seguenti opzioni descrive meglio come hai utilizzato Firefox in passato?
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-first-time = Ho iniziato a usare Firefox per la prima volta da poco
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-stopped-within-year = Usavo Firefox, ma ho smesso nel corso dell’ultimo anno
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-stopped-over-year = Usavo Firefox, ma ho smesso più di un anno fa
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-current-reinstall = Uso già Firefox e l’ho appena installato o reinstallato su questo dispositivo
# Button that submits the last survey answer.
nuts-submit = Invia
# Heading on the last screen of the survey.
nuts-thanks-title = Grazie!
# Thank-you message after the survey is submitted.
nuts-thanks-body = Grazie per averci dato la tua opinione. Ci aiuta a rendere Firefox ancora migliore.
